  "releaseNotes": "v12.8.3 - Image Scaling Fix (November 2025)\n            \n            BUG FIX:\n            🐛 Fixed UIImage scaling information (fixes #8)\n            🐛 Images now properly respect device pixel density (@2x, @3x)\n            \n            IMPROVEMENTS:\n            ✨ Correct scale factor returned in UIImage\n            ✨ Proper rendering on retina displays",
